BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sleepaway Camp: The Midnight Mass Experience (1983)
DTSTART:20260625T020000Z
DTEND:20260625T041500Z
DTSTAMP:20260625T020000Z
UID:LCJ0bNw1Nl
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 120 mins (2h00m)\n\nPeaches Christ Productions\, AGF
 A\, & Fangoria present: Sleepaway Camp: The Midnight Mass Experience Abo
 ut the Event: Join Peaches Christ\, original star\, "Angela" herself Felis
 sa Rose\, and Midnight Mass co-host Michael Varrati for a one-night-only c
 elebration of the cult horror classic Sleepaway Camp. The evening begins w
 ith a wildly entertaining live show featuring an opening drag performance\
 , a live onstage conversation with Felissa\, Michael\, and Peaches\, follo
 wed by an ’80s Camp Costume Contest with audience participation. After t
 he live show\, settle in for a screening of Sleepaway Camp on the big scre
 en!VIP ticket holders will be invited to a special meet-and-greet with Fel
 issa Rose\, Peaches Christ\, and Michael Varrati at the start of the film 
 screening\, including a photo opportunity and autographs (up to two items 
 per guest). Whether you’re a longtime fan or a first-time camper\, this 
 is a unique chance to experience Sleepaway Camp like never before.\n\nhttp
 s://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/sleepaway-camp\n\nEstimated start: 19:
 15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:E.T. the Extra-Terrestrial (1982)
DTSTART:20260531T180000Z
DTEND:20260531T201000Z
DTSTAMP:20260531T180000Z
UID:jeM5YkLPkU
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 115 mins (1h55m)\n\nCommunity Screenings A young boy
 \, Elliott\, discovers and befriends a friendly alien stranded on Earth. T
 ogether\, they embark on a heartwarming and magical adventure\, teaching u
 s the power of friendship\, love\, and the boundless wonders of the univer
 se. 4K restoration\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/community-s
 creenings/et-the-extra-terrestrial\n\nEstimated start: 11:15
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:BFDI & Inanimate Insanity 2026 Tour
DTSTART:20260823T193000Z
DTEND:20260823T214500Z
DTSTAMP:20260823T193000Z
UID:myXjPM4DKW
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 120 mins (2h00m)\n\nPresented by Jacknjellify LLC &
  Adamation\, Inc. The BFDI and Inanimate Insanity worlds collide for a on
 e-of-a-kind tour created especially for the Object Show Community. Experie
 nce an exclusive live premiere of never-before-seen episodes from BFDI: Th
 e Power of Two and Inanimate Insanity IV\, shown on the big screen for fan
 s in attendance.After the screening\, join a live Q&A featuring creators\,
  directors\, and voice actors from both series\, where audience members ca
 n ask questions and interact directly with the people behind the shows. At
 tendees will also have access to purchase event-exclusive merchandise\, ta
 ke part in themed photo opportunities\, and connect with fellow fans in a 
 shared celebration of the OSC.VIP ticket-holders gain access to a private 
 meet-and-greet with featured panelists and receive a limited-edition signe
 d print showcasing an extended version of the official tour logo. Tour pr
 oduction services are provided by The A. Noble Group\, Inc.\n\nhttps://www
 .siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/bfdi-and-inanimate-insanity-2026-tour\n\nEsti
 mated start: 12:45
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
